g period since avengers in  game in 2019 they have been steadily  replacing their original roster of  heroes with next generation versions and  adding in increasingly obscure  characters they then say according to  our trusted and proven source jason  statham is the latest star to join the  marvel cinematic universe and i should  point out that where it says trusted and  proven source that is a link to other  articles and other reports that they  have gotten correct in the past now if  this is true this is actually really  really huge but marvel has actually been  kind of doing this lately they have  gotten huge huge actors four phase four  and phase five projects in the mcu in  thor love and thunder alone the mcu is  about to introduce russell crowe as zeus  and christian bale as gore the  godbutcher two insanely huge actors also  in secret invasion that is coming out in  disney plus pretty soon they're getting  amelia clark to play a role and of  course you have to mention the eternals  the cast was incredible and we got  angelina jolie salma hayek richard  madden and so many more great characters  like jimmy chan in the mcu even though  gemma chan was already in the mcu and  captain marvel but we're just gonna  ignore that but this is something that  marvel is actively doing getting very  big actors and bringing them into the  mcu which is just awesome so who could  jason statham be playing he could be  playing a hero or he could actually be  playing a villain he also could be  playing somebody that doesn't have any  superpowers at all but he could be  somebody working for shield or i guess  sword now he could be somebody that  plays a major role in secret invasion or  he could straight up be a super hero now  jason statham is british and i would  love to actually see him play captain  britain now in the comics captain  britain isn't bald but that doesn't  necessarily mean that he has to have  hair on the mcu plus he does wear  something over his head anyways or 